# Run E2 (2026-11-06): run E (il_finetune_c0_iql_pin.env) with the actor's
# noise pinned PER ACTION at c0's own level, instead of one value for both.
#
# c0's log-std on recorded expert states (1,995 states from six il_data shards,
# Town05 and Town01): steering mean -3.70 (std 0.025; p10/p50/p90 -4.94 /
# -3.45 / -2.64), throttle mean -0.43 (std 0.65; -1.18 / -0.30 / +0.25). Run
# E's single -2.0 was their average, so it drives with 5x c0's steering noise
# and a fifth of its throttle noise. In run D the growth was in STEERING: -1.99
# at step 50k, -2.40 at 75k (throttle about unchanged).
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_iql_pin.env"
export ACTOR_LOG_STD=-3.70,-0.43
